OL,3,GNEWSAParents on children's 'emotionally
OL,4,Atricky' diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of two "amazing" children
OL,7,Fwith a genetic condition say dealing
OL,8,Fwith their diagnosis "emotionally is
OL,9,Fvery tricky".
OL,11,FChris and Alex, from Groby in
OL,12,FLeicestershire, have three sons - two
OL,13,Fof whom were diagnosed with Fragile X
OL,14,Fsyndrome - and have "significant
OL,15,Fdevelopmental delays".
OL,17,FThe condition causes physical
OL,18,Fabnormalities, behavioral issues and a
OL,19,Frange of other health problems,
OL,20,Fincluding developmental delays and
OL,21,Flearning disabilities.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
