OL,3,GNEWSAParents on children's 'emotionally
OL,4,Atricky' diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex said: "They are both amazing
OL,7,Fchildren, they struggle very much
OL,8,Facademically, they both go to a special
OL,9,Fneeds school."
